{"ts": 0.257111, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 1 of 3   Which command makes a variable visible to the programs the shell\r\n\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          starts?\r\n", "len": 119}
{"ts": 0.257196, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export\n", "len": 7}
{"ts": 0.257228, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "export\r\n", "len": 8}
{"ts": 0.260118, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          set    export    env    echo\r\n", "len": 52}
{"ts": 0.260154, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m ", "len": 29}
{"ts": 0.270603, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.274345, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 2 of 3   What does \u001b[92mPATH\u001b[0m hold?\r\n", "len": 53}
