{"ts": 0.291732, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 3 of 3   You type \u001b[92mPS1='me> '\u001b[0m, then \u001b[92mnext\u001b[0m. What is the prompt on the next\r\n\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m          screen?\r\n", "len": 135}
