{"ts": 0.32127, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mModule\u001b[0m \u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[93menv  task\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 249}
{"ts": 0.321317, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.321352, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97menv — task\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nShow that a child program can see a variable you exported.\r\n", "len": 87}
{"ts": 0.321395, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  1. Set TOPIC to the word \u001b[1mshell\u001b[0m.\r\n  2. Export it.\r\n  3. Run a child with \u001b[92mbash -c\u001b[0m that prints \u001b[92m$TOPIC\u001b[0m into seen.txt.\r\n\r\n\u001b[90mThis task runs in the module's own folder; \u001b[92mpwd\u001b[90m shows it.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Do the steps, then type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 283}
{"ts": 0.324296, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.324576, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.339557, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[?2004hshelltutor> ", "len": 20}
